# (1.3, the Performance release) PERFORM (SEL): every key an effect while held, several together; the white keys
# four groups of four (rhythm, echo, space, colour: w0-w3, w4-w7, w8-w11, w12-w15), the black keys eleven more; REC
# as on any page; no mutes. At rest the screen is a map of the keys' effects. Keys whose effect 1.3 has yet to build are dark and do nothing (w0 Stutter here).
# (on Blasket, AISLING's: both sequences on, Sequence 2 a quieter echo of the first)
wait 500
turn PRESET 4
wait 300
expect piece 4
listen
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
said PERFORM ON
expect pheld 0
expect platch 0
expect litbtn14 0
# an effect, held: said, its key dark; let go: gone, lit again (w4, key 7: Repeat)
# (the flash: the header and the main area its colour and name while held, gone two frames after; every colour reads
# with black lettering at 4.5:1 or better, every name and line fits)
expect pfcontrast 0
expect pffit 0
expect pflash 0
expect litkey7 1
key w4 down
wait 300
said Repeat
expect pheld 128
expect litkey7 0
expect pflash 1
key w4 up
wait 500
expect pheld 0
expect litkey7 1
expect pflash 0
# two together (w8 Reverb, key 14; w13 Phaser, key 23)
key w8 down
key w13 down
wait 300
said Phaser
expect pheld 8404992
key w8 up
wait 100
expect pheld 8388608
key w13 up
wait 100
expect pheld 0
# step 4's, each held and let go (w0 Stutter, w7 Reverse, w12 Flange, w15 Crush; b9 Comb): every key lit now
expect litkey0 1
key w0 down
wait 700
said Stutter
expect pheld 1
expect pflash 1
key w0 up
wait 100
expect pheld 0
key w7 down
wait 700
said Reverse
expect pheld 4096
expect pflash 1
key w7 up
wait 100
expect pheld 0
key w12 down
wait 700
said Flange
expect pheld 2097152
expect pflash 1
key w12 up
wait 100
expect pheld 0
key w15 down
wait 700
said Crush
expect pheld 67108864
expect pflash 1
key w15 up
wait 100
expect pheld 0
key b9 down
wait 700
said Comb
expect pheld 4194304
expect pflash 1
key b9 up
wait 100
expect pheld 0
# two buffered ones and Crush together: the last pressed sounds, the first comes back
key w0 down
wait 400
key w12 down
key w15 down
wait 800
key w12 up
wait 800
shot heavy.png
key w0 up
key w15 up
wait 300
expect pheld 0
# step 3's light effects, each held and let go: said, flashed, gone (w1 Half time, w2 Gate, w3 Roll, w14 Drive;
# b6 Dive, b7 Ring, b8 Vinyl)
key w1 down
wait 60
said Half time
expect pheld 4
expect pflash 1
key w1 up
wait 60
expect pheld 0
key w2 down
wait 60
said Gate
expect pheld 16
expect pflash 1
key w2 up
wait 60
expect pheld 0
key w3 down
wait 60
said Roll
expect pheld 64
expect pflash 1
key w3 up
wait 60
expect pheld 0
key w14 down
wait 60
said Drive
expect pheld 16777216
expect pflash 1
key w14 up
wait 60
expect pheld 0
key b6 down
wait 60
said Dive
expect pheld 32768
expect pflash 1
key b6 up
wait 60
expect pheld 0
key b7 down
wait 60
said Ring
expect pheld 131072
expect pflash 1
key b7 up
wait 60
expect pheld 0
key b8 down
wait 60
said Vinyl
expect pheld 1048576
expect pflash 1
key b8 up
wait 60
expect pheld 0
# three of them together, a while, and let go: the music goes on
key w2 down
key w14 down
key b7 down
wait 1500
expect pheld 16908304
shot light3.png
key w2 up
key w14 up
key b7 up
wait 400
expect pheld 0
expect pflash 0
# Drop held (the top black key, b10: key 25): both sequences out, the Drone goes on
key b10 down
wait 300
said Drop
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 0
expect notes_ch4 0
key b10 up
wait 300
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 >0
# Rise (b3, key 8): a move, not one of the grid's (what it does to the filters: blackkeys.amb, on Aran)
key b3 down
wait 300
said Rise
expect pheld 256
key b3 up
wait 3000
# REC is as everywhere else (Stephen, 2026-11-10: no latch): a tap is the echo's Hold
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 1
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 0
expect platch 0
wait 300
expect pheld 0
# left with a key held: let go
key b10 down
wait 200
expect pheld 33554432
tap SEL
wait 300
said PERFORM OFF
expect pheld 0
expect platch 0
key b10 up
wait 300
expect bfx 0
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 >0
# a page's button leaves PERFORM
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
# (0.5) SEL again leaves it too, back to the page it came from: here the Drone's, then its sound page
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 1
said PERFORM OFF
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 8
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 8
